{
  "id": "GET-MENU-ITEM-PROPERTY",
  "displayName": "GET MENU ITEM PROPERTY",
  "kind": "classic_command",
  "theme": "Menus",
  "overloads": [
    {
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "menu",
          "type": [
            {
              "kind": "concrete",
              "name": "Integer"
            },
            {
              "kind": "concrete",
              "name": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "direction": "in",
          "optional": false,
          "description": "Menu reference (MenuRef) or menu number."
        },
        {
          "name": "menuItem",
          "type": {
            "kind": "concrete",
            "name": "Integer"
          },
          "direction": "in",
          "optional": false,
          "sentinelValues": [
            {
              "value": -1,
              "meaning": "the last item added to the menu"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "property",
          "type": {
            "kind": "concrete",
            "name": "Text"
          },
          "direction": "in",
          "optional": false,
          "description": "A constant from the Menu Item Properties theme, or a custom property name."
        },
        {
          "name": "value",
          "type": {
            "kind": "pseudo",
            "name": "any"
          },
          "direction": "out",
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "process",
          "type": {
            "kind": "concrete",
            "name": "Integer"
          },
          "direction": "in",
          "optional": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "constraints": [
    "If menu is a menu reference (MenuRef), the process parameter is unnecessary and is ignored if passed; if menu is a menu number, process (if passed) designates which process's menu bar to use, defaulting to the current process.",
    "By default, if value is untyped or declared as text, the command returns a Standard Action name; to get the deprecated numeric 'Value for Associated Standard Action' constant instead, declare value as longint."
  ]
}